description "Imperial Storm Commando

Highly adaptive specialty soldiers.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 10% faster RoF

^8Attributes:
- 15% Faster Hacking
- Dexterity (1)
- Blast Armor
- Tracking Beacon
- 45% Faster Cooldowns
- Grapple Hop
- Slow Faller
- Anti MT (1)
- Bunny Hop (1)

^3Abilities:
- Dodge ^3[CS1]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]
- Gunkick ^3[CS3]"